# The build needs the cargo workspace, the skills setup.rs embeds, the README and the web app's sources; everything
# else (target/, infra/, .git/, docs, core dumps, local state, local web builds) stays out of the context.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!skills/
!README.md
!web/
crates/**/target/
crates/conde-remote/web-dist/
web/node_modules/
web/.svelte-kit/
